{"message":"The table on page 52 reports cash flow (net operating cash flow less property additions) of $950.4 million in 2004, $769.1 million in 2005, and $957.4 million in 2006. Their average is ($950.4 + $769.1 + $957.4)/3 = $892.3 million.","final":{"answer":892.3,"unit":"$ million","method":"Average of cash flow for 2004, 2005, and 2006","sources":["source:t3c1n0","source:t3c2n0","source:t3c3n0"],"result_id":"task:K/2006/page_52.pdf-2"}}